        "date": "2026-04-21T01:23:51Z"
      },
      "message": "feat: add backend for an instruction table\n\nThis new backend that can be generated with \"bundle exec ruby\nbin/container/udb-gen inst-table -o inst_table.txt\" is designed to organize the\nUDB instructions into a table modeled after the syscall table in Linux. The\nusecase for this is to commit the generated table into Linux which will then use\nthe table to generate the necessary instruction headers.\n\nSigned-off-by: Charlie Jenkins <thecharlesjenkins@gmail.com>",
